{{Documentation/Header}}
A navbox linking the four utaite activity-status badges, showing each badge as its own link label. Placed on the documentation of each status template so editors can move between them.

Takes no parameters.

==Syntax==
{{T|Status Templates}}

==The family==
* {{T|Active}} — currently active
* {{T|Inactive}} — no longer active
* {{T|Hiatus}} — on a temporary break
* {{T|Graduated}} — formally retired

{{T|Deceased}} is a memorial notice box rather than a status badge, and is deliberately not part of this navbox.

''{{T|Status Templates Nav}} is a redirect to this template.''
